text('Full synthetic fresh state and a departed pirate-boss trip are preserved in the runtime snapshot JSON. These are generated examples, not personal gameplay records.');

h(2,'20. Fresh balance audit: method, broad curves and ritual comparisons');
text('New audit date: October 17, 2026. '+audit.baselineRuns+' baseline sessions = 75 quests × levels 1/3/5/8 × no/ordinary/strong gear × two compositions × three seeds. '+audit.ritualPairedRuns+' additional sessions = 900 same-seed baseline/blessed pairs across ten queued rituals, three representative routes, levels 3/5/8, two compositions and five seeds. All runs start fresh; this does not simulate a continuing campaign, camp downtime or recovery costs. Zero recorded timer/extraction/campfire safety violations in the baseline. Runtime: '+num(audit.elapsedSeconds)+' seconds on the local audit host.');
code(audit.method);
text('Clear = final victory without automatic retreat; a clear can contain deaths/wounds. Death/wound columns are per-run member counts, not binary casualty probabilities. Strong gear is gifted in setup; its acquisition cost is not subtracted from quest income. Percentage strata have different quest counts and tiny per-quest seed samples. Compare like-for-like strata and inspect individual contracts.');
table(['Danger / level / gear','Runs','Clear %','Deaths/run','Wounded/run','Wipe %','Retreat %','Battles/run','Gold/run','Arcana/run','Breaks/run'],Object.entries(audit.groups).map(([key,g])=>[key,g.runs,pct(g.clears,g.runs),num(g.deaths/g.runs),num(g.wounds/g.runs),pct(g.wipes,g.runs),pct(g.retreats,g.runs),num(g.battles/g.runs),num(g.gold/g.runs),num(g.arcana/g.runs),num(g.breaks/g.runs)]));
h(3,'Class and ability balance follow-up');
const classAudit=json('docs/Polish_Class_Balance_20261017.json');
text(classAudit.method+' Total battles: '+classAudit.runs+'. Marginal rates include teammates and are not causal isolated class power. Full per-composition/scenario records and damage totals are in the JSON. Rogue base HP is now 5 and crit 25%; Ranger crit 20%; Knight L2 Armor gain and Barbarian L2 HP gain are each 1; Cleric retains 2 innate Ward and Mage crit is 15%; Barbarian Cleave no longer adds an unconditional extra +1 main-target damage. Class-specific weaknesses remain; single-battle success is not campaign balance.');
table(['Class / level','Party samples','Victories','Party win %'],Object.entries(classAudit.byClass).map(([id,r])=>[id,r.runs,r.wins,pct(r.wins,r.runs)]));
h(3,'Paired ritual results, aggregated across the three sampled routes and levels');
const ritualSummary=Object.entries(P.RITUALS).filter(([id])=>audit.ritualPairs.some(p=>p.ritual===id)).map(([id,r])=>{const pairs=audit.ritualPairs.filter(p=>p.ritual===id),valid=pairs.filter(p=>!p.blessed.castRejected),rejected=pairs.length-valid.length,avg=(side,key)=>valid.reduce((n,p)=>n+(p[side][key]||0),0)/valid.length;return{id,name:r.name,pairs:valid.length,rejected,baseClear:avg('baseline','clear'),blessedClear:avg('blessed','clear'),deathDelta:avg('blessed','deaths')-avg('baseline','deaths'),goldDelta:avg('blessed','gold')-avg('baseline','gold'),arcanaNetDelta:avg('blessed','arcana')-r.castCost-avg('baseline','arcana'),battleDelta:avg('blessed','battles')-avg('baseline','battles'),mercy:avg('blessed','mercySaves'),intercepts:avg('blessed','ritualInterceptions')};});
table(['Ritual','Valid pairs','Rejected casts','Base clear %','With rite %','Death delta/run','Gold delta/run','Arcana net delta/run','Battle delta/run'],ritualSummary.map(r=>[r.name,r.pairs,r.rejected,pct(r.baseClear,1),pct(r.blessedClear,1),num(r.deathDelta),num(r.goldDelta),num(r.arcanaNetDelta),num(r.battleDelta)]));
text('These are paired outcome diagnostics, not causal isolation of every modifier: a changed battle can change subsequent RNG consumption, target selection, survival, retreat and which encounters happen. Resource deltas include changed quest outcomes as well as the explicit ritual effect. Fortune is valid even when the party has no Ward. The baseline run is duplicated per ritual to preserve pairing. Immediate Healing/Greed/Reanimate/Last Rites are covered by explicit mechanics and unit/browser acceptance rather than forced into an unrelated damage-buff metric.');
h(3,'Quest-level observed payout per minute at L3 / ordinary gear');
const payouts=quests.map(q=>{const r=audit.rows.find(r=>r.questId===q.id&&r.level===3&&r.gear==='ordinary');return{q,r,gold:r.gold/r.runs/q.durationMinutes,arcana:r.arcana/r.runs/q.durationMinutes};});
table(['Quest','Min','Skulls','Clear % (n=6)','Actual Gold/min','Actual Arcana/min','Battles/run'],payouts.map(({q,r,gold,arcana})=>[q.name,q.durationMinutes,P.dangerRating(q),pct(r.clears,r.runs),num(gold),num(arcana),num(r.battles/r.runs)]));
text('Compare those payouts with the class-dependent camp rate (up to 12 Gold or Arcana/minute for three specialized camp members) and include XP, unlocks, risk, injuries, potions, repair cost, lost level investment and enjoyment. A quiet quest need not beat camp coin production to be useful, but the intended value proposition should be deliberate.');

