text('Full exact stdout/stderr is in `docs/Handoff_Test_Inventory_20261017.txt`; machine summary is the adjacent JSON. Likely obsolete clusters: 15-member/two-team rules, stance damage multipliers, old attack-minus-defense damage, repeated signature cooldowns, d20 death saves, removed medkits, old XP/camp rates and pixel/source-string assertions. Potentially relevant failures such as replay/leader succession require their own source/trace review before reclassification.');
